## Run MedShare AI in VS Code

### First-time setup

**Backend terminal** — run once:

```powershell
cd D:\newMed\backend
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install -r requirements.txt
Copy-Item .env.example .env
```

Generate your JWT secret **once**:

```powershell
python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(48))"
```

Copy the output into `backend/.env` as `JWT_SECRET=...`. Configure your database and Gemini API key there too. Keep this file private.

### Every time you run the project

**Terminal 1 — Backend**

```powershell
cd D:\newMed\backend
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
alembic upgrade head
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

**Terminal 2 — Frontend**

```powershell
cd D:\newMed\frontend
npm run dev
```

Open `http://localhost:5173`.

The JWT secret is saved in `.env`; do not regenerate it every time.

